{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "15b80371e05ca1e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_01",
      "hash": "21881e7a92c589fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "手下「阿波羅大人，\\n那邊那孩子是誰呀？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_01",
      "hash": "b87f44ae24543c27",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n那邊那個人是誰啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_02",
      "hash": "21881b7a92c584e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_02",
      "hash": "b87f45ae24543dda",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "15b80671e05ca6fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「那是個\\n愚蠢到膽敢妨礙我們，\\r\\n但又十分優秀的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_03",
      "hash": "b87f46ae24543f8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「……也就是說，\\n對我們來說，\\r\\n他們才是礙事的一方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_03",
      "hash": "21881c7a92c58697",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "手下「我說你呀！\\n竟敢說阿波羅大人礙事！\\r\\n是想被我們打到哭著回家嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "15b80571e05ca54a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「冷靜點。\\c\\n對付這樣的孩子，\\n應該要這樣教訓才是。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0910_dummy_01",
      "hash": "1a424c7cf4a00727",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0910_dummy_02",
      "hash": "1a424d7cf4a008da",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_04",
      "hash": "15b80071e05c9ccb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「原來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳上次贏過我\\n並不是一時僥倖啊……\\c\\n我完全明白了。\\n現在起我會好好注意你們的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_04",
      "hash": "2188197a92c5817e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "手下「讓開啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_04",
      "hash": "b87f3fae245433a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「好痛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_05",
      "hash": "b87f40ae2454355b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！\\n那個手下掉了這個東西！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0910_sys_01",
      "hash": "7e91e0790e71c998",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]鑰匙卡[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_06",
      "hash": "b87f41ae2454370e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「在成功拯救西爾佛之前，\\n就暫時借用一下吧！"
    }
  ],
